      <span class="cr-index">02 / SHARE</span>
      <h2>Declare rules for an organization, or just a single project.</h2>
      <p>Keep a rule in one project, or declare it in your organization's library as a shared default.
      Each project imports the shared rules it needs and can add its own rules or override them for local requirements.</p>
      <a href="/concepts/libraries/">See how rule libraries work →</a>
    </div>
